{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"Explain... Everything...\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T07:16:24.180000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738656294503710771","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"Dont bother mentioning the name of your leader but you will tell me all the names of those in the golden dawn\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T07:16:52.534000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738656413429268521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"Web exhales. ||\"On the night that Rah told you and Amara about Goanhawe's, Ebuc's ,and my membership in the golden dawn, he was summoned into our secret room by our leader. He was accused of telling our names to other people on the ship. Because our leader refused to explain anything, we were all initially disposed to believe Rah's claims of innocence. Seeing this, he explained exactly what he had magically seen Rah do. We questioned him and discovered he had been lying. I cannot speak as to why the others voted for Rah's death, but I did so out of fear of being found and thought a villain. I was also afraid that those who would think me a villain might be correct.\"||","created_at":"2020-07-31T07:21:07.017000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-31T07:21:19.238000Z","id":"738657480808333364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"Why did you join\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T07:22:33.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738657843594526811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"They continue. ||\"Our leader imprisoned and killed Rah, and we began making plans to cover up our involvement. I was personally hysterical, wrought with grief and regret, so my memory was wiped of the event. I know vaguely that Goanhawe planned to wipe your memory, but I had been put to sleep by that point so I do not know the full extent of his plan.\"||","created_at":"2020-07-31T07:23:51.382000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738658170205110282","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"||\"I joined.... I'm not really sure why. When you live your whole life so separate from those on the surface, you have little understanding of their politics or beliefs. I did not know the Golden Dawn's reputation, only that they could offer me much in exchange for simple tasks. By the time I realized what exactly was going on, I was in too deep.\"||","created_at":"2020-07-31T07:26:00.269000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738658710796107808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"Earlier today... I wouldve stabbed you where you stand and then do the same to Goan... Amaras last letter to me... she begged me not to destroy myself... I feel that killing you would do that... so you owe your life to Amara...\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T07:27:28.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738659082852106281","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
